---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="HP — Holistic Performance | OneMind OS" description="HP — the performance pillar. Mind, body, finance, habits.">
<!-- HP — Holistic Performance | /onemind/agents/hp/ -->
<section class="hero-full" style="min-height:auto;padding:3rem 0 2rem;">
  <div class="hero-badge">💪 PILLAR AGENT</div>
  <h1 style="font-size:2.8rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;"><span style="color:var(--accent-bright);">HP</span> — Holistic Performance</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub" style="font-size:1.1rem;max-width:600px;">Mind, body, finance, habits, and relationships — the human operating system. Deployable as a Hermes agent profile on your fabric.</p>
  <div style="margin-top:1.5rem;display:flex;gap:0.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <span class="stat-chip">Model: Qwen3.5 397B MoE</span>
    <span class="stat-chip">131K Context</span>
    <span class="stat-chip">💪 Performance</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:2rem 0;">
  <h2 style="color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:1rem;">Domain</h2>
  <p>Holistic Performance covers the human stack — everything that makes YOU run at peak capacity across all dimensions of life. Not just fitness. Not just productivity. All of it, integrated.</p>

  <div class="card-grid two-col" style="margin-top:2rem;">
    <div class="card">
      <h4>🧠 Mind</h4>
      <p>Cognitive performance, focus protocols, learning systems, mental models. HP tracks and optimizes your thinking.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h4>🏋️ Body</h4>
      <p>Fitness tracking, nutrition, sleep optimization, biometrics. Connected to wearables via the NATS fabric.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h4>💰 Finance</h4>
      <p>Cash flow monitoring, investment tracking, expense analysis. Personal CFO on the bus.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h4>🔁 Habits</h4>
      <p>Habit stacking, daily protocols, streak tracking, accountability nudges. Build the compound machine.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h4>🤝 Relationships</h4>
      <p>Connection tracking, communication cadence, relationship health scores. The people portfolio.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h4>⚡ Energy</h4>
      <p>Circadian alignment, stress monitoring, recovery scoring. HP knows when to push and when to rest.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:2rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);">
  <h2 style="color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:1rem;">How to Deploy</h2>
  <div style="background:var(--black-2);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
    <p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--accent-bright);">$ nats pub agents.prompt.hermes.zeus.hp "Log my workout: push day, 315lb squat 5x5"</p>
    <p style="margin-top:0.75rem;">HP responds at <code style="background:var(--black-3);padding:0.125rem 0.375rem;border-radius:0.25rem;">agents.prompt.hermes.zeus.hp</code>. Feed it data from wearables, spreadsheets, calendars — or just talk to it.</p>
  </div>
  <p><strong>Profile config:</strong> <a href="/resources/github/" style="color:var(--accent-bright);">omos-legacy → profiles/hp/</a></p>
</section>

<section style="padding:2rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);">
  <h2 style="color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:1rem;">Integration Points</h2>
  <p>HP connects to Apple Health, Whoop, Oura, Garmin, and manual logging. All data flows through the NATS bus into ClickHouse for long-term trend analysis. Legacy synthesizes HP data with SO/LE/GE for cross-domain insights — finance stress → sleep impact → performance degradation.</p>
</section>

<div style="text-align:center;padding:2rem 0;">
  <a href="/resources/starter-kit/" class="btn-primary" style="display:inline-block;font-size:1rem;">Get the Starter Kit →</a>
</div>
</BaseLayout>
